    <c4d-content-item-heading>
        


  
  
    
    AI and ML engineers

  





    


    </c4d-content-item-heading>
    <c4d-content-item-paragraph>
        <div class="cms-richtext  " id="rich-text-7264fa361f" data-dynamic-inner-content="description">
    <p>AI and ML engineers operationalize embedding models and manage retrieval logic for RAG and other <a href="https://www.ibm.com/think/topics/ai-inference" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer">inference</a> workloads. They depend on vector databases for low-latency lookups and embedding version management.</p>

    
    
    
    

</div>
    </c4d-content-item-paragraph>
    
</c4d-content-item>

    
    

</div>
<div class="pictogram-item">
<c4d-content-item horizontal>
    
    
