    <c4d-content-item-heading>
        


  
  
    
    Enterprise architects

  





    


    </c4d-content-item-heading>
    <c4d-content-item-paragraph>
        <div class="cms-richtext  " id="rich-text-6cca353c61" data-dynamic-inner-content="description">
    <p>Enterprise architects determine how vector databases integrate with <a href="https://www.ibm.com/think/topics/data-lakehouse" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer">lakehouses</a>, <a href="https://www.ibm.com/think/topics/data-governance" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer">governance</a> frameworks and <a href="https://www.ibm.com/think/topics/data-platform" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer">existing data platforms</a>, assessing <a href="https://www.ibm.com/think/topics/interoperability" target="_self" rel="noopener noreferrer">interoperability</a> and long-term architectural fit.</p>

    
    
    
    

</div>
    </c4d-content-item-paragraph>
    
</c4d-content-item>

    
    

</div>
<div class="pictogram-item">
<c4d-content-item horizontal>
    
    
